Column name: state_geo_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier for each state. Identical to state_fips_code
Column name: state_abbreviation Type: STRING Description: 2 letter abbreviation of state name as determined by the United States Postal Service
Column name: state_name Type: STRING Description: Full text name of state
Column name: legal_area_code Type: STRING Description: Current legal/statistical area description code for state
Column name: feature_class_code Type: STRING Description: MAF/TIGER feature class code. G4000 indicates "State or Equivalent Feature"
Column name: functional_status_code Type: STRING Description: Current functional status code. A full list of possible results can be found: https://www.census.gov/geo/reference/funcstat.html
Column name: area_land_meters Type: INT64 Description: Current land area, in square meters
Column name: area_water_meters Type: INT64 Description: Current water area, in square meters
